The docks of Hollow Spire smell of wet iron and recycled breath. Water haulers stand in rows, their tanks tagged and chained. Tamsin Vey sits at a ledger stall under a flickering lamp, writing without looking up. A stack of survey chits weighs down one corner of her page. <npc>"You've got the look of someone who wants a favor,"</npc> she says, still writing. <npc>"Favors cost extra here."</npc>

